
# vercel.json works for dynamic sites it seems and not static ones

## Comments API environment variables (Vercel project settings)

- LIBSQL_URL — Turso/libSQL database URL for persistent SQLite in production
- LIBSQL_AUTH_TOKEN — Turso auth token (required with remote libSQL)
- RESEND_API_KEY — sends verification emails via Resend
- FROM_EMAIL — verified sender address in Resend (default: comments@nkosikhonadlamini.xyz)
- SITE_ORIGIN — optional canonical site URL (e.g. https://blog.nkosikhonadlamini.xyz)

Local dev uses file:data/comments.db when LIBSQL_URL is unset.
